      "text": "And one was planned for getting off the stage",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 23.82,
      "end": 28.28,
      "text": "The calendar keeps knocking at the door",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 29.16,
      "end": 32.94,
      "text": "The same old rules are scattered on the floor",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 33.84,
      "end": 37.48,
      "text": "I learned my long way around can still be true",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 38.5,
      "end": 42.38,
      "text": "When every painted arrow points to you",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 44.84,
      "end": 48.9,
      "text": "There are side roads under every sign",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 48.9,
      "end": 53.68,
      "text": "There is daylight if you give it time",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 55.36,
      "end": 60.36,
      "text": "Step out, put your heart where the headlights shine",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 60.36,
      "end": 64.9,
      "text": "Take your turn, make a little room to fire",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 64.9,
      "end": 68.2,
      "text": "Turn the noise into a song tonight",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 69.28,
      "end": 73.04,
      "text": "You were made for more than standing by",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
      "start": 74.2,
      "end": 78.72,
      "text": "Hands up, let the hard days fall behind",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 78.72,
      "end": 83.52,
      "text": "Run toward the spark you came to find",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
